  m_text: "<color=#FFD866><b>\uC5D0\uB514\uD130\uC5D0\uC11C \uC124\uC815\uD558\uB294 \uACF3</b></color>\nWindow > Rendering > <b>Lighting</b> > Environment\n\xB7 <b>Skybox Material</b> : \uD558\uB298 (Create > Material,\n  Shader = Skybox/Procedural \uB610\uB294 6 Sided/Cubemap)\n\xB7 <b>Sun Source</b> : \uD0DC\uC591 Directional Light\n\xB7 Environment Lighting <b>Source</b> : Skybox / Gradient / Color\n\xB7 Intensity Multiplier : \uD658\uACBD\uAD11 \uC138\uAE30\n\n<color=#9BE89B>\uCF54\uB4DC</color> (\uC774 \uB370\uBAA8)\nRenderSettings.skybox = \uBCF5\uC81C\uD55C \uBA38\uD2F0\uB9AC\uC5BC;\nRenderSettings.ambientSkyColor = gradient.Evaluate(t);\nsun.transform.rotation = \uC2DC\uAC04 \u2192 \uAC01\uB3C4;\nDynamicGI.UpdateEnvironment(); // \uBC18\uC0AC\xB7\uD658\uACBD\uAD11 \uAC31\uC2E0"
